#### clamps to the last tab for a click past the end

- Verify: clamps to the last tab for a click past the end


<details>
<summary>Executable SSpec</summary>

Runnable source: 9 lines folded for reproduction.
Reproduction: this block contains the complete executable scenario source.

```simple
step("Verify: clamps to the last tab for a click past the end")
# @req: REQ-SSPEC-LOCAL-001
var mgr = TabManager.new()
mgr.new_tab("a")
mgr.new_tab("b")
mgr.new_tab("c")
# 1024 / 3 = 341 per slot; x=1023 is past idx 2 due to rounding.
val idx = hit_test_tab_strip(mgr, 1023, 5, 1024)
expect(idx == 2).to_be_true()
```

</details>

